0..66 Comment "// What a written forgetting map refuses: a map at another carrier"
67..142 Comment "// than the model\'s is a map the model does not stand at, a sort the theory"
143..221 Comment "// does not have is no member of it, and a sort written twice, a bracket entry"
222..294 Comment "// that is no binding or a map onto a type that is no theory\'s models is"
295..308 Comment "// malformed."
